--TEST--
signature help on an `is` type test answers none, since no method call and no attribute payload encloses the cursor, `rule:attributes/an-attribute-is-declared-with-its-sites`, `rule:ide/the-request-set-is-closed`
--FILE--
<?nvs
interface Shape
{
    public function area(): int;
}

class Square implements Shape
{
    public function area(): int { return 4; }
}

mixed $s = new Square();
if ($s i<|>s Shape) {
    echo $s->area();
}
--REQUEST--
